Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.62,0:01:36.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.55,0:01:38.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.97,0:01:40.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好恶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.93,0:01:42.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好恶是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.45,0:01:44.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是对待女朋友的态度吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.25,0:01:47.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别装着很拽的样子好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.62,0:01:50.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以前一直被你欺负得很惨
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.45,0:01:52.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在要报复喽
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.09,0:01:54.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么报复啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.71,0:01:56.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敦敦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.11,0:02:01.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.23,0:02:03.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个女生…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.07,0:02:06.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是住在大谷隔壁的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.27,0:02:08.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.18,0:02:08.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是美美
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.89,0:02:11.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你女朋友真有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.33,0:02:14.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕 要迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.95,0:02:16.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都怪你磨磨蹭蹭的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.95,0:02:18.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明是你在犯傻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.81,0:02:20.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美 再见啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.16,0:02:28.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宣战通告！！醋意燃烧的危险美少女！！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.12,0:02:29.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.71,0:02:34.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不告诉我们 干嘛都保密啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.06,0:02:35.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候的事？他是怎么跟你求婚的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.27,0:02:36.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊 恭喜恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.53,0:02:38.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,学长 是真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.47,0:02:40.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.90,0:02:42.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.43,0:02:43.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真让人感动
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.30,0:02:47.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这对活宝搭档终于成为情侣了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.62,0:02:50.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.62,0:02:52.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.95,0:02:53.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也太小题大做了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.30,0:02:54.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.45,0:02:57.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 理莎 为什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.40,0:02:59.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再考虑下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.94,0:03:02.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟这样的家伙在一起很奇怪诶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.08,0:03:02.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么叫这样的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.29,0:03:06.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我闭嘴 微型人 少得意忘形
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.20,0:03:07.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁得意忘形了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.83,0:03:10.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…你这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.83,0:03:16.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.08,0:03:21.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早就知道 这一天迟早会来的…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.75,0:03:30.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 刚刚老师在找你们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.16,0:03:32.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经结束了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.44,0:03:39.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,暑假补习的作业忘记了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.13,0:03:42.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.20,0:03:45.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到了这种时候 再下点功夫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.57,0:03:47.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下周一之前给我交出来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.80,0:03:48.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.74,0:03:59.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然完全忘记了…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.55,0:04:02.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们分工合作吧 作业
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.59,0:04:06.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去哪做？跟铃木他们去图书馆吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.10,0:04:07.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.42,0:04:12.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一到图书馆那种寂静的地方 就会有快要窒息的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.48,0:04:14.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确会有窒息的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.18,0:04:22.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么到我家去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.45,0:04:25.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.30,0:04:30.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你回来啦 敦敦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.36,0:04:33.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟女朋友一起啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.51,0:04:36.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么会在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.31,0:04:39.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把今天的牛奶带来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.39,0:04:40.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,牛奶？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.73,0:04:45.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙说要让我长高每天都送牛奶过来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.13,0:04:47.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天的牛奶很棒哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.06,0:04:51.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是从北海道直接运来的高钙鲜奶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.69,0:04:54.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么好笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.09,0:04:57.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为…牛奶…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.87,0:05:03.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没其他事了吧 那就赶紧回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.82,0:05:06.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美想跟敦敦的女朋友说说话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.08,0:05:09.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 我们要学习了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.16,0:05:14.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事啦大谷 就一会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.52,0:05:20.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就一小会儿哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.12,0:05:21.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.89,0:05:25.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敦敦 下来一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.49,0:05:27.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事啊 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.69,0:05:35.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好可爱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.41,0:05:38.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美看起来好修长
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.90,0:05:40.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你多高啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.50,0:05:41.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,172公分
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.10,0:05:44.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇 跟我一样哎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.16,0:05:46.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.39,0:05:51.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是敦敦一直说她讨厌比他高的人诶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.72,0:05:54.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.27,0:05:58.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过他好像不介意我的身高 不知道为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.34,0:06:03.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 敦敦以前的女朋友是个很娇小的女生 你知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.46,0:06:04.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.17,0:06:07.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既娇小又可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.05,0:06:10.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以美美才对敦敦死心了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.16,0:06:18.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美 你喜欢大谷？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.81,0:06:22.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是敦敦喜欢娇小的女生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.79,0:06:24.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美却长得这么高
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.34,0:06:29.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以为了让敦敦长高 就每天给他送牛奶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.60,0:06:31.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.77,0:06:34.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我决定等哪天敦敦比我高了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.34,0:06:37.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就要做敦敦的女朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.64,0:06:40.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个…那个…真对不起…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.49,0:06:50.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没戳到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.03,0:06:55.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起？你以为你是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.97,0:06:59.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底对敦敦使了什么卑鄙的手段
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.06,0:07:06.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想被我用乌冬面穿鼻打结是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.59,0:07:09.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不…不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.36,0:07:12.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敦敦怎么可能要你这种女人当女朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.00,0:07:14.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美美…美
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.29,0:07:16.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要用你那恶心吧啦的嘴叫我的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.69,0:07:22.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要是再敢接近敦敦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.15,0:07:26.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就让你下半辈子求生不得 求死不能
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.98,0:07:31.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,茶点来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.30,0:07:33.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷 救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.40,0:07:37.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蛋糕蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.76,0:07:42.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美要吃芒果冻 可以嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.21,0:07:44.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请用…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.61,0:07:47.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇 敦敦的女朋友好温柔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.54,0:07:51.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才那个是幻觉？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.13,0:07:54.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.03,0:07:57.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没…没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.53,0:08:06.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是幻觉…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.77,0:08:09.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那是什么表情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.20,0:08:12.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美 吃完这个就回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.54,0:08:13.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.84,0:08:29.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到她是模特
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.49,0:08:33.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷的邻居看起来很厉害呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.18,0:08:36.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是美美啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.03,0:08:43.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟大谷说也没用的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.31,0:08:49.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 也不用太介意啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.99,0:08:54.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作业都交了 一起去玩玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.73,0:08:55.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.59,0:08:59.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管被别人说了什么或做了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.39,0:09:01.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要有大谷的爱 我就很幸福了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.48,0:09:03.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敦敦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.41,0:09:10.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么会在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.21,0:09:13.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美想多了解一下的敦敦的女朋友嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.51,0:09:16.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以今天约好了一起出去玩 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.22,0:09:23.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧好吧 那你们两个一起回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.17,0:09:25.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敦敦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.47,0:09:27.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不像在两个女巨人的包围下回家
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.14,0:09:30.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不就成了被挟持的外星人了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.69,0:09:31.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我扁你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.85,0:09:33.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.41,0:09:36.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等…等下 大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.61,0:09:37.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.63,0:09:41.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老太婆 你搞清楚状况了没
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.37,0:09:43.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我过来谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.75,0:09:47.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会变成这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.17,0:10:00.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直盯着我看…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.82,0:10:07.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像你这样的家伙是怎么跟敦敦交往起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.95,0:10:10.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我非常努力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.63,0:10:15.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋 我也非常非常努力啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.62,0:10:18.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在敦敦面前 美美表现得很可爱对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.92,0:10:24.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自从懂事起 美美就一直这样子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.32,0:10:25.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这有多辛苦你知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.05,0:10:28.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那…那真是太辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.85,0:10:31.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不只是那样…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.59,0:10:34.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了让敦敦长高 我天天给他送牛奶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.89,0:10:37.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是他从初一开始就一点都没长高
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.55,0:10:38.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的假的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.01,0:10:39.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.27,0:10:42.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是与之相反的是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:46.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美小学毕业的时候就已经170公分了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.00,0:10:50.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 我小学六年级的时候也有168公分了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.30,0:10:52.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骗人 真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.29,0:10:56.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 从幼儿园开始 每次排队一定是最后一个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.59,0:10:57.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美也是 美美也是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.04,0:11:00.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美比班里最高的男生还要高呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.83,0:11:04.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是啊 真的很讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.16,0:11:06.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做什么都很引人注意
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.28,0:11:09.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是啊 稍微说句话就被老师抓到……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.27,0:11:13.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁跟你在这里话当年啊 你个白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.91,0:11:15.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦 偏题了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.45,0:11:16.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.12,0:11:23.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以当那个娇小可爱的女生成为敦敦的女朋友后
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.01,0:11:25.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美也就死心了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.06,0:11:29.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 我们这种身高比都没法比
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.70,0:11:30.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我懂我懂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.21,0:11:31.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.23,0:11:34.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女孩真的不错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.47,0:11:36.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来还以为是个心机很重的黑心女呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.38,0:11:38.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 跟美美完全不一样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.58,0:11:40.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对啊对啊 美美就是个黑心女…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.50,0:11:42.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真多嘴 给我闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.32,0:11:43.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁黑心啊 猪头
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.38,0:11:45.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对…对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.24,0:11:48.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好不容易等到他跟那个女孩分手
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.71,0:11:49.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到下一个居然是你这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.17,0:11:51.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人高马大又白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.28,0:11:55.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之 美美绝不会输给你的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.71,0:11:57.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会抢回敦敦的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.06,0:12:01.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要说的就这些
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.64,0:12:04.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等…等下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.29,0:12:06.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.25,0:12:16.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对…对不起 能不能借我点钱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.28,0:12:20.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只带了50元
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.62,0:12:21.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,50…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.86,0:12:23.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有50元还敢进餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.45,0:12:24.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真是败给你的勇气了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.72,0:12:28.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我忘了我早上买了杂志
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.92,0:12:32.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为美美实在太可爱 就忍不住买下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.49,0:12:34.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真拿你没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.84,0:12:36.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只此一次 我就破例借给你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.37,0:12:39.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇 你人真好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.06,0:12:49.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把钱包忘在学校了 怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.62,0:12:58.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,630日元
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.82,0:13:02.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是存心的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.40,0:13:04.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的很对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.46,0:13:07.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敦敦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.30,0:13:11.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢她哪点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.15,0:13:13.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么突然提这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.59,0:13:16.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为她和你之前的女朋友类型完全不同
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.44,0:13:18.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又比你高
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.28,0:13:20.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只带50元还敢进餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.50,0:13:22.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我实在不懂 她到底哪里好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.10,0:13:27.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里不是说这话的地方吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.91,0:13:29.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说吧 美美想知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.15,0:13:34.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够了吧 这跟美美你没关系吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.92,0:13:40.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.77,0:13:41.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然有关系
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.73,0:13:44.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美比她更喜欢敦敦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.93,0:13:47.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.00,0:13:51.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是在开玩笑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.85,0:14:01.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敦敦你这个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.69,0:14:02.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.54,0:14:03.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.68,0:14:06.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.73,0:14:15.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为 我完全明白美美的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.19,0:14:42.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敦敦他说了什么没有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.21,0:14:45.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他生美美的气了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.44,0:14:48.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有…他没生气
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.39,0:14:54.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是美美一时冲动骂了敦敦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.49,0:14:58.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敦敦你这个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.56,0:15:04.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事不必在意
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.71,0:15:06.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷他本来就是个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.75,0:15:10.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难得有人告白 这个白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.71,0:15:11.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敦敦才不是笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.15,0:15:14.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,突然被告白谁都会吓一跳的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.63,0:15:15.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是美美不好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.78,0:15:18.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不准说敦敦的坏话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.30,0:15:26.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来不想在这种情况下告白的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.99,0:15:30.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不该一时冲动 突然这样告白的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.24,0:15:38.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都怪你这个混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.51,0:15:42.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是你这混蛋把美美的人生搞得一团糟
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.82,0:15:45.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底要怎么赔偿我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.61,0:15:48.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别不说话 你说说看你想怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.38,0:15:51.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真想就这样掐死你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.19,0:15:56.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美…美？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.62,0:16:01.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.08,0:16:07.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她一定很沮丧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.32,0:16:10.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然在大谷面前本性毕露
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.71,0:16:11.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是怎么回事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.00,0:16:15.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道平常跟我在一起的美美都是装出来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.49,0:16:19.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在喜欢的人面前当然想装可爱喽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.97,0:16:21.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是这样的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.54,0:16:22.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真恶心真恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.75,0:16:23.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶心是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.97,0:16:26.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看吧 又来了 你这样哪里可爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.73,0:16:28.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不是你嘴贱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.49,0:16:30.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说这个了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.11,0:16:33.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美有联系过你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.25,0:16:37.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个啊 她有说今天放学三个人一起去玩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.99,0:16:39.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为…为啥
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.94,0:16:43.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美已经豁出去了 决定动真格了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.43,0:16:48.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动真格是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.77,0:16:52.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么可爱的女生要动真格的话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.13,0:16:53.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷这个笨蛋会不会……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.37,0:16:57.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝不会输的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.60,0:17:01.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会让至今的努力都白费的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.37,0:17:05.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就去敦敦想去的地方吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.47,0:17:06.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.51,0:17:08.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.18,0:17:12.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…你们等…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.80,0:17:14.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 敦敦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.17,0:17:23.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你们了 离我远一点好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.86,0:17:34.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玩哪个玩哪个
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.71,0:17:37.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个空着呢 我们过去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.28,0:17:38.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敦敦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.23,0:17:58.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦 美美呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.50,0:18:05.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在这里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.06,0:18:07.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美也来玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.53,0:18:11.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.02,0:18:14.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美要回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.75,0:18:15.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.06,0:18:21.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有话必须要跟你说清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.24,0:18:23.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不要听
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.18,0:18:29.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想拒绝我是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.53,0:18:35.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.86,0:18:38.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.10,0:18:39.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不要听
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.56,0:18:41.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.87,0:18:43.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不要听
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.76,0:18:46.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美 你听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.03,0:18:50.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要 我不想听
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.16,0:18:50.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对小泉…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.91,0:18:53.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.24,0:18:54.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住口！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.31,0:18:54.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.08,0:18:56.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我！…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.89,0:18:57.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不管
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.79,0:18:58.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.90,0:19:02.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…干吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.28,0:19:05.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是说比我更喜欢大谷吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.08,0:19:07.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是嘴上说说而已吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.70,0:19:12.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身为女朋友的你怎么会明白被拒绝的人…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.15,0:19:12.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.15,0:19:14.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也曾被拒绝过两次
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.41,0:19:18.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也曾想过放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.32,0:19:20.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我还是没办法死心 所以一直都在努力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.63,0:19:23.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骗人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.43,0:19:26.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然说现在是他的女朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.26,0:19:28.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还是会骂我白痴猪头恶心什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.83,0:19:31.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看他那样子 谁知道是不是真心喜欢我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.85,0:19:33.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.50,0:19:36.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 因为我太喜欢他了 所以不在乎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.97,0:19:46.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不会把大谷交给害怕拒绝选择逃避的人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.16,0:20:03.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…美美回去的时候还很生气吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.38,0:20:05.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不是才不是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.37,0:20:08.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说是没办法变成像你这样的白痴 所以对我死心了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.13,0:20:10.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.69,0:20:17.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一开始被敦敦拒绝的时候 一定非常痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.49,0:20:21.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是却一直努力直到敦敦回应她
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.54,0:20:24.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.16,0:20:39.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚刚都说了些什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.77,0:20:42.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么不明白是不是真心喜欢之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.38,0:20:46.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是一时冲动
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.37,0:21:00.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还特地站在高处
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.84,0:21:04.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不然就没这么帅了不是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.29,0:21:05.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.49,0:21:16.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然发生了很多事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.53,0:21:21.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真希望两个人就这样在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.68,0:21:23.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直到永远
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.29,0:21:28.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在出试卷吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.41,0:21:32.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是 是之前发下去的志愿表
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.40,0:21:35.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经到了要做最后决定的时刻了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.84,0:21:37.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.72,0:21:40.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,ALL阪神 巨人终于也要解散啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.06,0:23:07.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,预告
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.32,0:23:07.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一起上大学吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.41,0:23:07.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.86,0:23:11.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟大谷分开的话以后会怎样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.11,0:23:14.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恋爱情结 love com 次回
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.28,0:23:17.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,分别的预感？！理莎和大谷各自步上人生之路
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.45,0:23:17.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要看噢
